  "shapes": [
    "automatic-restore",
    "ledger-entry-restored",
    "archived-soroban-entries",
    "rent-fee",
    "config-upgrade-state-archival"
  ],
  "why": "From Protocol 23 a transaction can restore archived entries it lists in archived_soroban_entries; its operation meta shows LEDGER_ENTRY_RESTORED for the entry and its TTL, followed by UPDATED for the write, with no STATE change. Readers that expect every UPDATED to follow a STATE, or that ignore RESTORED, get the entry's history wrong.",
